@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

### Time Series Event Analytics (Zero-filled)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics/events?bucket=hour
Accept: application/json

### Camera Operational Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics/cameras
Accept: application/json

### Threat Score Breakdown & Priority Counters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics/threats
Accept: application/json
